<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan central bank to hold board meeting Jan 30.</title>
<headline>Taiwan central bank to hold board meeting Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Tuesday it will hold its board meeting on Thursday, January 30, to review the island's monetary policy.</p>
<p>&quot;The central bank will hold a board meeting on January 30 at 1600 (0800 GMT), and will hold a press conference after that,&quot; a central bank official said by telephone.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
